# ruff: noqa: E501  (the README text below is a Markdown table; wrapping would break it)
"""Write synthetic sample files for the manual verification checklist.

    python -m tests.fixtures.generate_manual_samples [output_dir]

The default output directory is ``<project root>/sample-evidence``. Every file is
generated, labelled synthetic, and uses invented names and reserved example domains.
The files are plain inputs: this script never touches the database or evidence
storage, and refuses to write inside ``backend/var``.
"""

